# What git is to leave alone anywhere in the repository. Only what is true of all of it
# is here. Each app has its own list beside it, because what one platform's tools throw
# off, the other may well use as an ordinary name: mac/.gitignore and windows/.gitignore.

# What the Finder and Explorer leave behind
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Built and packaged releases
*.zip
*.dmg

# The tools (Python)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
